•nausea and vomiting;

•reduced appetite;

•headache;

•effects on mood, depression, anxiety and other psychiatric manifestations; and

•other effects, for which an investigator reported as unrelated to setmelanotide or for which no increased incidence or pattern or causal relationship is currently evident.

